  d. Offer paid sublicenses or other paid rights to Owner's Software.

Internal use by a business is allowed. You may charge for independent reports,
analysis, or other work produced using the Software, subject to the attribution
in section 4, if the customer is not receiving a copy of the Software or paid
access to its functionality. You may charge separately for consulting, training,
installation, or support if obtaining and using the Software remains free and
the service fee is not a condition for a Software license or paid access.

